St. Louis?

22
00:04:20,017 --> 00:04:21,624
Yeah.

23
00:04:21,624 --> 00:04:24,405
It's to go home
for my dad's 60th birthday.

24
00:04:24,405 --> 00:04:26,707
And the "Meicho" will let
their star reporter

25
00:04:26,707 --> 00:04:28,836
