110
00:16:28,392 --> 00:16:30,999
<i>He's chasing my clients away.
Who the fuck is he?</i>

111
00:16:30,999 --> 00:16:33,084
Hayama.

112
00:16:33,084 --> 00:16:36,299
He's the <i>wakagashira</i>
of Chihara-kai--

113
00:16:36,299 --> 00:16:37,906
Ishida's number two.

114
00:16:37,906 --> 00:16:39,687
Sato's supposed to
look after my club.

115
