- Mm-hmm.

222
00:26:22,041 --> 00:26:24,560
Will you talk to Ishida?

223
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:27,254
Make him understand
Hayama's bad for business.

224
00:26:27,254 --> 00:26:30,643
The Oyabun will keep
him out of the club

225
