226
00:26:35,944 --> 00:26:36,812
The architect.

227
00:26:36,812 --> 00:26:40,071
Ohno-san?
What about him?

228
00:26:40,071 --> 00:26:41,157
He works for the city--

229
00:26:41,157 --> 00:26:42,765
