246
00:27:34,204 --> 00:27:37,116
But now all he wants is you.

247
00:27:39,809 --> 00:27:41,895
So you must finish the job.

248
00:27:43,458 --> 00:27:45,457
And if I say no?

249
00:27:45,457 --> 00:27:48,107
Please, trust me...

250
00:27:48,107 --> 00:27:49,541
